The one where you hook it on to climb up.

1795
01:05:25,819 --> 01:05:27,389
(Do you not recognise him?)

1796
01:05:27,519 --> 01:05:29,459
- He must be a gamer.
- What?

1797
01:05:29,459 --> 01:05:30,559
- He's probably a gamer.
- My goodness.

1798
