Hello. I'm not the owner of the jar dessert cafe.

1799
01:05:34,829 --> 01:05:36,699
I'm Officer Jeong Hwak Seok...

1800
01:05:36,699 --> 01:05:38,229
from the PR and Media Division of Ulju-gun Office.

1801
