A lot of places promote like this these days, right?

1807
01:05:48,839 --> 01:05:50,949
- Onggi Man.
- I think I saw him on YouTube.

1808
01:05:51,749 --> 01:05:52,949
Right. This is the game.

1809
01:05:53,279 --> 01:05:54,679
He's really unique.

1810
01:05:54,679 --> 01:05:56,579
- He tries really hard.
- My goodness.

1811
01:05:56,579 --> 01:05:59,219
(A star of the Onggi Festival, hitting 850,000 views!)

1812
01:05:59,289 --> 01:06:02,519
- I can't believe this.
- I thought he looked so kind.

1813
01:06:03,119 --> 01:06:04,489
He's so funny and delightful.

1814
