1910
01:09:27,829 --> 01:09:30,359
It's hot. That's what H.O.T. means.

1911
01:09:30,599 --> 01:09:31,669
It's hot. And candy...

1912
01:09:32,129 --> 01:09:33,329
(Whatever the clue is, it's just exciting.)

1913
01:09:33,329 --> 01:09:35,399
I see. It's hot.

1914
01:09:35,799 --> 01:09:36,799
What's the third one?

1915
01:09:37,439 --> 01:09:39,069
(What you had in your hands at the last place)

1916
01:09:39,069 --> 01:09:41,639
(Fortune cookies)

1917
01:09:41,839 --> 01:09:43,879
I didn't really get it.

1918
01:09:43,979 --> 01:09:46,179
- What is this?
- What's this?

1919
01:09:46,979 --> 01:09:48,379
What's that weird thing?

1920
01:09:48,379 --> 01:09:49,419
(It contained a fortune.)

1921
01:09:49,419 --> 01:09:52,119
(What is that?)

1922
01:09:52,419 --> 01:09:54,689
(Another word for a jar)

1923
