("Dok")

1924
01:09:56,189 --> 01:09:57,329
"Dok?"

1925
01:09:58,129 --> 01:09:59,989
(Combine the word "Dok" with your fortune.)

1926
01:09:59,989 --> 01:10:01,299
Combine it with the fortune?

1927
01:10:01,299 --> 01:10:03,559
(Here is an example.)

1928
01:10:03,559 --> 01:10:05,129
(You can soar even higher if repaired.)

1929
01:10:05,129 --> 01:10:06,569
("Dok")

1930
01:10:06,569 --> 01:10:07,799
An eagle?

1931
01:10:07,799 --> 01:10:09,599
(Because it becomes an eagle)

1932
01:10:09,599 --> 01:10:10,739
That's crazy.

1933
01:10:11,209 --> 01:10:13,739
(Here's another example.)

1934
01:10:13,739 --> 01:10:15,179
(The closer you are to wealth, the more people follow.)

1935
01:10:15,179 --> 01:10:16,739
("Dok")

1936
01:10:16,739 --> 01:10:18,079
- A good rapport.
- A good rapport.

1937
01:10:18,079 --> 01:10:19,379
(Because you build a good rapport)

1938
01:10:19,379 --> 01:10:20,779
Gosh, that is...

1939
01:10:21,579 --> 01:10:22,619
Good...

1940
01:10:22,749 --> 01:10:24,589
So that's how it goes.

1941
01:10:24,949 --> 01:10:25,989
(Germany, subscription, detox, criticism, reading)

1942
01:10:25,989 --> 01:10:27,119
Seriously...

1943
01:10:27,119 --> 01:10:28,659
Germany, subscription...

1944
01:10:28,659 --> 01:10:30,419
- Germany, subscription...
- That's crazy.

1945
01:10:31,159 --> 01:10:34,399
(Fourth)

1946
01:10:34,399 --> 01:10:35,659
- There was a fourth one?
- Fourth?

1947
01:10:35,659 --> 01:10:36,699
(The self cameras they were carrying)

1948
01:10:36,699 --> 01:10:37,869
I was thinking,

1949
01:10:37,869 --> 01:10:39,899
"Since when did this number appear?"

1950
01:10:39,899 --> 01:10:41,269
- What is that?
- I knew it was strange.

1951
01:10:42,599 --> 01:10:45,109
Right. I wondered why there were numbers.

1952
01:10:45,109 --> 01:10:46,339
(There were numbers on the self cameras?)

1953
01:10:46,339 --> 01:10:47,839
Normally, you eat it raw, but you can also eat it cooked?

1954
01:10:47,839 --> 01:10:51,549
(Mysterious numbers on cameras)

1955
01:10:52,079 --> 01:10:53,409
- What do they mean?
- What do they mean?

1956
01:10:53,409 --> 01:10:54,879
They weren't there before?

1957
01:10:54,879 --> 01:10:56,579
No. We suddenly got them.

1958
01:10:56,579 --> 01:10:58,019
Why didn't you tell me?

1959
01:10:58,019 --> 01:10:59,089
I don't know.

1960
01:10:59,089 --> 01:11:00,189
