1961
01:11:00,189 --> 01:11:01,859
Oh, the order of alphabets.

1962
01:11:02,089 --> 01:11:06,689
(The numbers meant the order of the alphabets.)

1963
01:11:06,689 --> 01:11:08,799
(Fruit)

1964
01:11:09,029 --> 01:11:10,699
Am I dumb?

1965
01:11:11,299 --> 01:11:14,339
Dear Sixth Sense crew, this place is fake.

1966
01:11:14,339 --> 01:11:16,199
(Fake)

1967
01:11:16,199 --> 01:11:17,439
Oh, well done.

1968
01:11:17,769 --> 01:11:19,509
(Anyway, it was a successful day today.)

1969
01:11:19,509 --> 01:11:21,539
- Still, we were lucky.
- Yes, we still got it.

1970
01:11:21,539 --> 01:11:25,149
I feel fooled even after getting it right.

1971
01:11:25,149 --> 01:11:27,779
- Right.
- Anyway, we got it.

1972
01:11:27,779 --> 01:11:28,819
(Anyway, they still did it.)

1973
01:11:28,819 --> 01:11:32,289
(Let's try it again next week.)

1974
01:11:32,419 --> 01:11:33,989
(I like him so much.)

1975
01:11:33,989 --> 01:11:35,759
(The girls are especially shy today.)

1976
01:11:35,889 --> 01:11:38,059
