1978
01:11:40,189 --> 01:11:42,899
(We play father and son in the drama.)

1979
01:11:42,899 --> 01:11:44,269
(What?)

1980
01:11:44,269 --> 01:11:45,669
(I'm his stepson.)

1981
01:11:45,669 --> 01:11:47,439
(Now it makes sense.)

1982
01:11:48,299 --> 01:11:50,199
(Don't be biased.)

1983
01:11:50,199 --> 01:11:51,539
