1988
01:12:01,019 --> 01:12:02,679
(Embarrassed)

1989
01:12:02,679 --> 01:12:04,489
(Liar. You're a liar of 100 days.)

1990
01:12:04,489 --> 01:12:06,449
(Lying on a variety show)

1991
01:12:06,689 --> 01:12:08,389
(On the other hand, they have a mystery-solving ace.)

1992
01:12:08,819 --> 01:12:10,089
(Are you sure?)

1993
01:12:10,959 --> 01:12:12,959
(His reasoning is on another level.)

1994
01:12:13,089 --> 01:12:14,759
(That's sharp.)

1995
01:12:14,759 --> 01:12:16,559
(Jinyoung is a genius.)

1996
01:12:16,559 --> 01:12:18,099
(Jinyoung, what's your thought?)

1997
01:12:18,099 --> 01:12:19,569
(It seems fake to me.)

1998
01:12:19,569 --> 01:12:21,839
(To call it fake...)

1999
01:12:22,139 --> 01:12:24,169
(You said it was fake just 2 minutes ago.)

2000
01:12:24,169 --> 01:12:25,969
(Why do you keep changing your mind, Jinyoung?)

2001
01:12:26,139 --> 01:12:28,239
(He keeps changing his mind.)

2002
01:12:28,739 --> 01:12:29,909
(Do you think it's fake?)

2003
01:12:29,909 --> 01:12:31,309
(Let me try the food first.)

2004
01:12:31,479 --> 01:12:32,809
(Because I keep changing my mind)

2005
01:12:33,079 --> 01:12:34,979
(Eyes shut tightly)

2006
01:12:34,979 --> 01:12:36,149
He keeps changing his mind.

2007
01:12:36,149 --> 01:12:38,219
(It's hard to make up my mind.)

2008
01:12:38,489 --> 01:12:40,449
(What's going to happen to these clumsy father and son?)
